OL,3,GNEWSADog owners without poo bags could
OL,4,Aface fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog owners who fail to carry poo bags
OL,7,Fwhen walking their pets could face
OL,8,Ffines under new proposals.
OL,10,FSheffield City Council will consider
OL,11,Fplans for a "dogs in public spaces
OL,12,Fprotection order", which would allow
OL,13,Fenforcement officers to take action
OL,14,Fagainst owners who fail to clear up
OL,15,Fafter their dogs or let them off the
OL,16,Flead near playgrounds and primary
OL,17,Fschools.
OL,19,FLabour councillor Mark Rusling, who
OL,20,Fcame up with the idea, said he had
OL,21,Fheard anecdotally that schemes
OL,22,Felsewhere had been successful.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
