OL,3,GNEWSADog owners without poo bags could
OL,4,Aface fines
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Ultimately, it's the dog owner's
OL,7,Fresponsibility to clear up their dog's
OL,8,Fmess. It's not our council workers,
OL,9,FAmey workers, or members of the
OL,10,Fpublic," he said.
